@startuml use_case_1_temporal
title Use Case 1: Proactive Temporal Reasoning\n(Analogy 3: Planning Capability)

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

participant "Game\nEnvironment" as Env
participant "State\nExport" as State
participant "LLM Agent\n(DeepSeek-R1)" as Agent
participant "Network\nInfrastructure" as Net

== Decision #4 (t=240s) — Day phase, 179s until night ==

Env -> State: Export state\n(cov=100%, phase=day,\nremaining=179s)
State -> Agent: Query

note right of Agent
  **Agent reasoning:**
  "Adjusting slice ratios to better
  handle expected traffic shifts during
  day/night transition and prevent
  future QoS violations."
end note

Agent -> Net: reconfig_slice(BS1, eMBB=0.4, URLLC=0.5, mMTC=0.1)
Net --> Env: Slice ratios updated

== Night falls (t=300s) — Engineers return to housing ==

Env -> Env: eMBB demand shifts\nto residential zones

note over Net
  QoS maintained ✓
  (slice pre-configured
  for housing eMBB load)
end note

== Dawn (t=360s) — Engineers commute back ==

Env -> Env: eMBB demand shifts\nto corridors
Env -> State: Export state\n(cov=100%, no violations)

note over Agent #LightGreen
  **Result:** No QoS violation
  because agent anticipated
  the demand shift.
end note

@enduml


@startuml use_case_2_debugging
title Use Case 2: Debugging Trace — Missed Opportunity\n(Analogy 1: Declarative Debugging)

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

participant "City Economy\n(STAI)" as City
participant "Game\nEnvironment" as Env
participant "State\nExport" as State
participant "LLM Agent" as Agent
participant "Network" as Net

== Decision #5 (t=300s) — cov=100%, 0 disconnected ==

City -> Env: +7 new units built\n(expanding outward)
Env -> State: Export state\n(cov=100%, disc=0, phase=night)
State -> Agent: Query
Agent -> Net: **reconfig_slice**(BS1, 0.4, 0.4, 0.2)

note right of Agent #Yellow
  Agent chose reconfig
  instead of placement.
  **No coverage extension.**
end note

Net --> Env: Slice updated (no new coverage)

== 60 seconds pass — units move beyond coverage ==

City -> Env: Units expand to\nnew mex locations
Env -> Env: 8 units now\noutside all BS range

== Decision #6 (t=360s) — INTENT VIOLATION ==

Env -> State: Export state\n**(cov=63%, disc=8)** ⚠️
State -> Agent: Query

note over State #LightCoral
  **FAIL: Coverage dropped**
  **100% → 63% in one step**
  
  Root cause:
  • Units expanded +7
  • All outside coverage
  • Agent reconfigured instead
    of extending coverage
end note

Agent -> Net: place_bs(macro_cell, 7328, 9048)

note right of Agent
  **Too late** — coverage
  already violated for 60s
end note

== Backward Trace (Debugging) ==

note over Agent #LightBlue
  **Counter-factual:**
  If place_bs at t=300s instead
  of reconfig → estimated
  coverage: ~85% (regret: 22%)
end note

@enduml


@startuml use_case_3_spatial
title Use Case 3: Spatial Reasoning Under Sustained Pressure\n(Analogy 2: Strategic Context Requirement)

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

participant "City Economy" as City
participant "Environment" as Env
participant "LLM Agent\n(full context)" as AgentFull
participant "LLM Agent\n(no positions)" as AgentBlind
participant "Network" as Net

== Continuous expansion: t=960s, cov=57%, 141 disconnected ==

City -> Env: Economy keeps\nexpanding outward\n(+5 units/min)

Env -> AgentFull: State with BS positions:\n[BS1@(5320,9040), BS2@(6500,7800),\n BS3@(5384,7960)...]

note right of AgentFull #LightGreen
  "Extending coverage **north**
  to reach disconnected units"
  
  → Reasons about WHERE gap is
  → Places at (5320, 10040)
  → Correct direction
end note

AgentFull -> Net: place_bs(macro, 5320, 10040)

|||

Env -> AgentBlind: State WITHOUT positions:\nonly "57% coverage, 141 disconnected"

note right of AgentBlind #LightCoral
  Cannot determine WHERE
  the gap is.
  
  → Guesses position
  → May overlap existing BS
  → May miss the frontier
end note

AgentBlind -> Net: place_bs(macro, 7000, 8000)\n(overlaps existing coverage)

|||

note over Net
  **Result after 30 min:**
  Full context: 52.5% avg coverage
  No positions: 46.6% avg coverage
  
  Δ = −5.9% (spatial info value)
end note

@enduml
